---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { path } from '../i18n/routes';
---

<BaseLayout lang="nl" page="praktisch" title="Praktische informatie">
<section class="night" style="position:relative;padding-top:clamp(80px,10vw,144px);overflow:hidden"><img class="hero-media" src="/assets/slaap-netwerken_foto141.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1280"><div class="shade-side" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap" style="position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;padding-bottom:clamp(64px,8vw,104px)"><h1 style="font-size:clamp(40px,5.6vw,72px);font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;max-width:920px">Locatie, hotel en accreditatie</h1><p class="lead" style="color:#C9CDE3;max-width:760px">SLAAP2027 vindt plaats in NH Conference Centre Koningshof in Veldhoven, vlak bij Eindhoven.</p><nav aria-label="Op deze pagina" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:8px"><a class="chip" href="#locatie">Locatie</a><a class="chip" href="#hotel">Hotel</a><a class="chip" href="#route">Route</a><a class="chip" href="#accreditatie">Accreditatie</a></nav></div></section><section id="locatie" class="sec" style="scroll-margin-top:24px"><div class="wrap grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(420px,100%),1fr));gap:32px;align-items:stretch"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px"><h2 class="h2">Congreslocatie</h2><address class="panel" style="font-style:normal;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><p><strong>NH Eindhoven Conference Centre Koningshof</strong><br>Locht 117<br>5507 RM Veldhoven</p><p style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px"><a href="tel:+31402537475">+31 (0)40 253 74 75</a><a href="mailto:nhkoningshof@nh-hotels.com">nhkoningshof@nh-hotels.com</a><a href="https://www.nh-hotels.com/en/hotel/nh-eindhoven-conference-centre-koningshof">Website NH Koningshof</a></p></address></div><div class="panel-night" style="position:relative;min-height:340px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;text-align:center;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(110,195,238,0.08) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(110,195,238,0.08) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:40px 40px"><span style="color:#6EC3EE"><svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s7-6.2 7-12a7 7 0 0 0-14 0c0 5.8 7 12 7 12z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"></circle></svg></span><p style="font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF"><em class="ph">[Kaart]</em></p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=NH+Koningshof+Locht+117+Veldhoven"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5"></path></svg>Open in Google Maps</a></div></div></section><section id="hotel" class="sec" style="background:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #DADDE8;scroll-margin-top:24px"><div class="wrap grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(420px,100%),1fr));gap:40px;align-items:center"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:820px"><h2 class="h2">Hotelkamer boeken</h2><p class="lead muted" style="max-width:760px">Een hotelovernachting is niet inbegrepen in de registratie. Boek je kamer rechtstreeks bij NH Koningshof via de congreslink; boek op tijd voor de meeste keus.</p></div><div><a class="btn btn-dark" href="#"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 18V7M3 14h18v4M21 14v-2a3 3 0 0 0-3-3h-7v5"></path><circle cx="7" cy="11" r="2"></circle></svg>Hotelkamer boeken</a></div></div></section><section id="route" class="sec" style="scroll-margin-top:24px"><div class="wrap" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32px"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:16px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:820px"><h2 class="h2">Route</h2></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=NH+Koningshof+Locht+117+Veldhoven"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5"></path></svg>Plan je route</a></div><div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(420px,100%),1fr))"><div class="panel" style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start"><span class="action-icon" style="flex:0 0 56px"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 16V11l2-5h10l2 5v5M3 16h18v3H3zM5 11h14"></path><circle cx="7.5" cy="16" r="0.5"></circle><circle cx="16.5" cy="16" r="0.5"></circle></svg></span><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><h3 class="h3">Met de auto</h3><p class="muted"><em class="ph">[Routebeschrijving en parkeerinformatie]</em></p></div></div><div class="panel" style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start"><span class="action-icon" style="flex:0 0 56px"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="3" width="14" height="14" rx="3"></rect><path d="M5 11h14M8 21l2-4M16 21l-2-4"></path><circle cx="9" cy="14" r="0.6"></circle><circle cx="15" cy="14" r="0.6"></circle></svg></span><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><h3 class="h3">Met het openbaar vervoer</h3><p class="muted">Het dichtstbijzijnde intercitystation is Eindhoven Centraal. <em class="ph">[Bus- of taxiverbinding naar Koningshof]</em></p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="accreditatie" class="sec" style="background:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #DADDE8;scroll-margin-top:24px"><div class="wrap" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:820px"><h2 class="h2">Accreditatie</h2><p class="lead muted" style="max-width:760px">Accreditatie wordt aangevraagd. Zodra punten zijn toegekend, zie je hier het aantal per beroepsvereniging.</p></div><div class="tbl-box"><table class="tbl"><caption style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0)">Accreditatiepunten per beroepsvereniging</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Beroepsvereniging</th><th scope="col">Punten</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Beroepsvereniging Verzorgenden &amp; Verpleegkundigen (V&amp;VN)</td><td class="tabular" style="white-space:nowrap"><em class="ph">[n]</em> punten</td></tr><tr><td>Verpleegkundig Specialisten Register (VSR)</td><td class="tabular" style="white-space:nowrap"><em class="ph">[n]</em> punten</td></tr><tr><td>Nederlandse Associatie van Physician Assistants (NAPA)</td><td class="tabular" style="white-space:nowrap"><em class="ph">[n]</em> punten</td></tr><tr><td>Kwaliteitsregister Tandartsen (KRT)</td><td class="tabular" style="white-space:nowrap"><em class="ph">[n]</em> punten</td></tr><tr><td>KABIZ, Laboranten Klinische Neurofysiologie (NVLKNF)</td><td class="tabular" style="white-space:nowrap"><em class="ph">[n]</em> punten</td></tr><tr><td>Nederlandse Vereniging van Artsen voor Longziekten en Tuberculose (NVALT)*</td><td class="tabular" style="white-space:nowrap"><em class="ph">[n]</em> punten</td></tr><tr><td>Federatie van Gezondheidszorgpsychologen en Psychotherapeuten (FGzPt)</td><td class="tabular" style="white-space:nowrap"><em class="ph">[n]</em> punten</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="muted" style="font-size:16px;max-width:880px">* Andere medisch specialisten: volgens de huidige regels geldt accreditatie door één wetenschappelijke vereniging van medisch specialisten (hier de NVALT) ook voor de andere beroepsverenigingen. De punten worden dan toegekend als vakoverstijgende punten.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
